<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-AU">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title><%= pageTitle %></title>
<meta name="description" content="<%= metaDescription %>">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/unifiedcoms.css">
<link rel="icon" href="/images/favicon.ico">
</head>
<body>

<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap page-hero__row">
    <div class="page-hero__copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">Products &amp; Services</span>
      <h1>Unified Comms</h1>
      <p>Modern businesses need communication that's seamless, flexible, and built for the way teams actually work. We deliver integrated voice and collaboration solutions that keep your people connected in the office, on the road, or working remotely.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary">Schedule an obligation-free chat</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="comms-plans-row">
      <div class="comms-plans-row__copy">
        <h1>Plans that scale with your team</h1>
        <p>Start with cloud calling and add video, analytics or a full contact centre as you grow — no re-platforming required.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="comms-plans-row__media" data-reveal>
        <img src="/images/3cx-phone.webp" alt="3CX softphone app" class="comms-plans-row__img comms-plans-row__img--front" loading="lazy">
        <img src="/images/t85w-large.webp" alt="Yealink T85W desk phone" class="comms-plans-row__img comms-plans-row__img--back" loading="lazy">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== Greater Flexibility ===== -->
<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="feature-strip__head">
      <h1>Greater Flexibility</h1>
      <p>Running your telephone lines over a data network provides your business with greater functionality, reliability and flexibility.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-strip__grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-card__icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3v18M8 7l4-4 4 4M8 17l4 4 4-4"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Scale Up or Down</h3>
        <p>Quickly and easily scale users (and costs) up and down. All requests are free of charge.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-card__icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 20v-4M9 20v-8M14 20v-12M19 20V4"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Superior Voice Quality</h3>
        <p>Experience calls in high definition sound. We use the highest quality voice codec available.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-card__icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 12c0-1.7 1.3-3 3-3s3 1.3 3 3-1.3 3-3 3-3-1.3-3-3zm9 0c0-1.7 1.3-3 3-3s3 1.3 3 3-1.3 3-3 3-3-1.3-3-3z"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Unlimited or Pay-As-You-Go</h3>
        <p>We will recommend the model that best suits your business needs.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== 1300 & 1800 Numbers ===== -->
<section class="section--tint">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="feature-strip__head">
      <h1>1300 &amp; 1800 Numbers</h1>
      <p>Our 13/1300 and 18/1800 numbers allow you to combine all services onto a single bill.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-strip__grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-card__icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M9 15c0-1 .8-1.5 1.6-1.9.9-.5 1.4-.9 1.4-1.6 0-.9-.7-1.5-1.5-1.5S9 10.6 9 11.5M4 4l16 16"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>No Flagfall</h3>
        <p>Including international calls and calls to mobile.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-card__icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="13" r="8"/><path d="M12 9v4l2.5 2.5M9 3h6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>First 20 Minutes FREE</h3>
        <p>The first 20 minutes for all local calls are unmetered and free.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-card__icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="13" r="8"/><path d="M12 13V9M9 3h6M4.5 6.5l1.4 1.4"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Per Second Billing</h3>
        <p>Only pay for what you use with per second billing.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== Perfect for Multiple Sites ===== -->
<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="feature-strip__head">
      <h1>Perfect for Multiple Sites</h1>
      <p>Our dedicated IP voice products are perfect for businesses with multiple sites.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-strip__grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-card__icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="6" r="2"/><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="2"/><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="2"/><path d="M12 8v4M12 12l-5 4M12 12l5 4"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Free Calls Between Sites</h3>
        <p>Perfect for businesses with multiple sites.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-card__icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="6" y="3" width="12" height="6" rx="1"/><rect x="4" y="9" width="16" height="8" rx="1"/><rect x="8" y="17" width="8" height="4" rx="1"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Compatible with Fax / EFTPOS</h3>
        <p>Evolve Voice and Multiline work with Fax and EFTPOS.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-card__icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12a8 8 0 0 1 13.5-5.8M4 6v4h4M20 12a8 8 0 0 1-13.5 5.8M20 18v-4h-4"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Greater Flexibility</h3>
        <p>Increase or decrease channels in single increments, not blocks of 10.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== CRM integration ===== -->
<section class="section--tint">
  <div class="wrap comms-integration">
    <div class="comms-integration__copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">Hosted Voice, Unified Communications (UC), and SIP</span>
      <h1>Integrate Your CRM</h1>
      <p>Connect your voice and collaboration tools directly into your CRM to streamline workflows, improve customer experience, and give your team instant access to the information they need, right when they need it.</p>
      <p class="comms-integration__subhead">Native, maintained integration for the following platforms</p>
    </div>

    <ul class="comms-integration__list">
      <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Fully Managed UCaaS (Unified Communications)</li>
      <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> AI Agent</li>
      <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> SIP</li>
      <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> CRM Integration – Salesforce, HubSpot, Pipedrive, Zoho, Zendesk</li>
      <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Professional messages on hold</li>
      <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Live Answer — a human answers your calls out of hours and passes through your message, for a professional and personal touch with your clients, every time.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="section-head__copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">Proud 3CX Partner</span>
        <h1>3CX plans built around your business</h1>
        <p>All plans are hosted and fully managed, with unlimited local, national and mobile calling included — never metered per call.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="carousel" data-carousel>
      <div class="carousel__viewport">

        <article class="plan-card">
          <p class="plan-card__name">SMB 10 Users</p>
          <p class="plan-card__data">10<span>users</span></p>
          <p class="plan-card__sub">Cloud-based phone system for a single site — core features at a cost-effective price</p>
          <ul class="plan-card__list">
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Licensing &amp; hosting included</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> 4 simultaneous internal &amp; external calls</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Phone, mobile, computer &amp; web apps</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Unlimited calls to fixed, mobile &amp; 13/1300</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary btn--sm">Schedule a chat</a>
        </article>

        <article class="plan-card">
          <p class="plan-card__name">4 Lines</p>
          <p class="plan-card__data">4<span>lines</span></p>
          <p class="plan-card__sub">A seamless, unified communications experience — recommended for up to 15 users</p>
          <ul class="plan-card__list">
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Licensing &amp; hosting included</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> 4 external and 8 internal simultaneous calls</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Phone, mobile, computer &amp; web apps</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Unlimited calls to fixed, mobile &amp; 13/1300</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary btn--sm">Schedule a chat</a>
        </article>

        <article class="plan-card">
          <p class="plan-card__name">8 Lines</p>
          <p class="plan-card__data">8<span>lines</span></p>
          <p class="plan-card__sub">A seamless, unified communications experience — recommended for up to 30 users</p>
          <ul class="plan-card__list">
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Licensing &amp; hosting included</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> 8 simultaneous internal &amp; external calls</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Phone, mobile, computer &amp; web apps</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Unlimited calls to fixed, mobile &amp; 13/1300</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary btn--sm">Schedule a chat</a>
        </article>

        <article class="plan-card">
          <p class="plan-card__name">Enterprise Configuration &amp; Deployment</p>
          <p class="plan-card__data">Custom<span>build</span></p>
          <p class="plan-card__sub">Full deployment and configuration for multi-site, high-complexity environments</p>
          <ul class="plan-card__list">
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Deployed to AWS with firewall &amp; FQDN setup</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> SIP registration and trunk configuration</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Users, extensions, call handling &amp; office hours</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Single sign-on &amp; multi-site number porting</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary btn--sm">Schedule a chat</a>
        </article>

      </div>

      <div class="carousel__controls">
        <button type="button" class="round-btn" data-carousel-prev aria-label="Previous unified comms plans">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M10 2L4 8l6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="carousel__progress"><div class="carousel__progress-bar"></div></div>
        <button type="button" class="round-btn" data-carousel-next aria-label="Next unified comms plans">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M6 2l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="carousel__dots"></div>
      <p class="scroll-hint">
        Swipe or drag to compare plans
        <svg width="14" height="10" viewBox="0 0 14 10" fill="none"><path d="M1 5h11M8 1l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== Microsoft 365 with Teams ===== -->
<section class="section--tint">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="feature-strip__head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Microsoft Partner</span>
      <h1>Microsoft 365 with Teams</h1>
      <p>Licensed and billed by Business ICT Australia, provisioned directly on your own Microsoft 365 tenant.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-strip__grid feature-strip__grid--2col">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-card__icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M3 7l9 6 9-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Microsoft 365 Business Basic with Teams</h3>
        <p>Host email with a 50 GB mailbox and custom email domain address.</p>
        <p>Use web and mobile versions of Office, Outlook and Teams.</p>
        <p>Store and share files with 1 TB of OneDrive cloud storage per user.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-card__icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="3"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-6"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Microsoft 365 Business Premium with Teams</h3>
        <p>Host email with a 50 GB mailbox and custom email domain address.</p>
        <p>Use desktop, web and mobile versions of Office, Outlook and Teams.</p>
        <p>Store and share files with 1 TB of OneDrive cloud storage per user.</p>
        <p>Secure devices and identities with Intune, Defender for Business and Entra ID P1.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="feature-strip__note">12-month term, paid upfront. Quantities can be increased but not reduced during the term — at the end of the term, licences convert to month-to-month.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section--tint">
  <div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;">
    <h1>Ready to unify your comms?</h1>
    <p style="margin-inline:auto;">Tell us how your team communicates and we'll map out the right setup — no pressure, no obligation.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary">Schedule an obligation-free chat</a>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>

<script src="/js/main.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>

